echo "${x#*b}" "${x##*b}" "${x%b*}" "${x%%b*}"
echo "${x#"*"b}"
@2.2.3/5 | T | Inside double quotes, in ${x:-word} forms the word keeps literal value except for " ` $ and backslash; backslash also escapes }
> quote/dq_in_param
--- quote/c_dq_default_word
