echo "${u:-a  'b'  *}"
echo "${u:-a\}b}"
echo "${u:-$HOME}"
@2.2.3/6 | T | Inside double quotes a backquote introduces command substitution, ended by the next unescaped backquote
--- quote/c_dq_backquote
