@2.3/3 | T | An unquoted blank delimits a token and is discarded
--- parse/c_blanks
echo    a		b	c
@2.3/4 | T | A # at the start of a word begins a comment up to but excluding the newline; inside a word it is literal
> parse/comments_ok
--- parse/c_comment_word
