> session:c_alias_interactive
@2.3.1/9 | T | Aliases are part of the environment a subshell duplicates
--- alias/c_subshell
alias hi='echo hello'
(hi sub)
echo "$(hi cmdsub)"
@2.4/1 | T | Reserved words are recognized only unquoted and in command position
