> session:echo_hi session:ps1_param
@2.5.3/10 | S | In PS1 each ! is replaced by the history number of the next command, and !! by one !
> session:c_ps1_bang
@2.5.3/11 | S | PS2 is expanded and written to standard error when a command continues onto another line; default "> "
> session:ps2_if
